{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19481","headline":"城内花园颇曾游翫令公居守亦有素期适春霜一夕委谢书实以荅令狐相公见谑 · 刘禹锡","name":"城内花园颇曾游翫令公居守亦有素期适春霜一夕委谢书实以荅令狐相公见谑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼下芳园最占春，年年结侣采花频。\n繁霜一夜相撩治，不似佳人似老人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}